    <string name="guide_title">How to pair</string>
    <string name="guide_steps">1. Tap “Make visible” below.\n2. On the tablet open Settings › Connections › Bluetooth and select this phone.\n3. Accept the pairing request on both devices.\nThe tablet then sees a keyboard and mouse — no app is needed on it.</string>

